  "text": "## Risk Appetite Philosophy  \n**We seek to achieve sustainable profitability through:**\n1. **High-Quality Customer Service** — Reliable, fair banking services\n2. **Financial Stability** — Capital above regulatory minimums with buffers\n3. **Strong Compliance** — Zero tolerance for willful regulatory breaches\n4. **Operational Excellence** — Reliable systems, robust controls, continuous improvement  \n**We will NOT pursue:**\n- High-risk lending strategies\n- Aggressive growth in loss-making areas\n- Shortcuts around compliance or controls\n- Concentrated exposure to single customers/sectors\n- Excessive leverage or capital risk  \n---",
